---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us">
  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12 leading-[0.9]">Welcome to Rupam Precision Engineering</h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-8 text-xl md:text-3xl text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
        <p>Rupam Precision Engineering is a distinguished manufacturer specializing in the production of customized precision machined components. With a heritage of excellence spanning 10 years, our commitment to delivering top-quality components has made us a trusted name in the manufacturing industry.</p>
        
        <p>Our unwavering focus on precision, quality, and customer satisfaction has earned us a reputation for reliability and excellence. We have proudly served clients in a wide range of industries, from aerospace to automotive and medical equipment manufacturers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-400 text-lg font-light">
      <p>At Rupam Precision Engineering, our commitment to excellence extends beyond machinery and instruments. Our team of highly skilled and experienced professionals is dedicated to delivering precision and quality in every project we undertake.</p>
      <p>Whether you require components with intricate geometries, tight tolerances, or unique specifications, you can trust us to meet your exacting requirements.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-neutral-900 aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
      <span class="text-neutral-600 tracking-widest text-sm">[ PLACEHOLDER: TEAM OR CRAFTSMANSHIP VISUAL ]</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Advanced Machinery</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">Our impressive manufacturing facility boasts a comprehensive array of cutting-edge machinery, including a total of 14 CNC and VMC machines. These machines are equipped with advanced technology, enabling us to achieve unparalleled precision in every component we produce.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">State-of-the-art Quality</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">We take immense pride in our state-of-the-art quality instruments, such as Coordinate Measuring Machines (CMM), Contracer measuring machines, height gauges, and roughness testers. These instruments play a crucial role in our rigorous quality control processes, ensuring that each component meets the highest industry standards.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
